# Close work on {{PROJECT_NAME}}

The code is the source. A document holds only what no file can say; history
is `git log`; a number lives beside the command that measures it, or nowhere.

## Steps

1. Reuse the review's proof run if the tree did not change since (same key);
   otherwise run the proof commands once.
2. `{{TRIM_COMMAND}}` — every finding is trimmed or kept with a reason.
3. Rewrite `{{STATE_DOC}}`: focus, next step, open items; pass or fail beside
   each command, with HEAD. No counts.
4. Each new fact goes to the one document that owns its subject (table).

